(text "03 Programmable source, eight isolated RF outputs and envelope" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f3725d58-73ff-5f6e-8062-b848e0961a38"))
(text "Si5351A-B-GT factory outputs disabled. CLK0 is the only used output; HCT TTL VIH >=2V.\nEight outputs each have a separate 100R ballast (MINI50), 560R (FOX10 initial).\nQ4 RC supply envelope is experimental: verify HCT behavior below 4.5V during edges.\nRF_ENABLE hardware pull-down -> Q6 OFF -> both OE_N HIGH. Oscillator retune only with RF inhibited." (at 18 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c8301ed-773a-5788-904e-08d58405bbd2"))
